# Source renders — 293 MB, 293 MB and 592 MB, and only ever inputs to
# `npm run frames`. The optimised WebP the site actually serves is committed
# under public/frames, so a fresh clone builds and deploys without them.
#
#   DESKTOP FRAMES/  the 16:9 landscape render, 1280x720
#   Mobile/          the 9:16 portrait render, 1080x1920
#   MOBILE FRAMES/   superseded — a byte-for-byte copy of DESKTOP FRAMES
DESKTOP FRAMES/
Mobile/
MOBILE FRAMES/
